Q: Accessing hidden member through derived instance selects base class member A: <p><code>private</code> and <code>new</code> are independent modifiers. I don't believe we need explicit documentation to define how they both interact. But for completeness;</p>
<pre class="lang-cs prettyprint-override"><code>public class Base
{
    public string Value1 =&gt; &quot;Base1&quot;;
    public string Value2 =&gt; &quot;Base2&quot;;
}
public class Derived : Base {
    private new string Value1 =&gt; &quot;Derived1&quot;;
    public string GetValue1() =&gt; Value1;
    public new string Value2 =&gt; &quot;Derived2&quot;;
}

var d = new Derived();

Assert.Equal(&quot;Base1&quot;, d.Value1);
Assert.Equal(&quot;Derived1&quot;, d.GetValue1());
Assert.Equal(&quot;Derived2&quot;, d.Value2);
Assert.Equal(&quot;Base1&quot;, ((Base)d).Value1);
Assert.Equal(&quot;Base2&quot;, ((Base)d).Value2);
</code></pre>
<p><code>private</code> properties are only visible from within the class. <code>new</code> members hide the equivalent member from the base type.</p>
<p>Paraphrasing the <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/language-specification/expressions#125-member-lookup" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Member Lookup</a> documentation.</p>
<p>At each call site, all &quot;accessible members&quot; are discovered. Any members hidden by other members are removed. If there is one member left, then it must be what the programmer intended.</p>
<p>Since <code>Derived.Value1</code> is only accessible from within <code>Derived</code>. Only accesses within that class will use it.</p>
<p>Since <code>Derived.Value2</code> is accessible from anywhere. Any access via a variable of type <code>Derived</code> will use it.</p>
<p>In all other cases, <code>Base.ValueX</code> will be referenced.</p>

Q: Cmake not passing -Wl,-rpath-link while building through yocto A: <p>I got this issue resolved by adding the following in the <code>CMakeLists.txt</code></p>
<pre><code>target_link_options(${PROJECT_NAME} PRIVATE
    # ensures CMake emits -Wl, for compiler drivers like q++
    LINKER:-rpath-link,${QNX_SYSROOT_LIB_PATH}
)
</code></pre>
